WEBVTT

00:00:25.572 --> 00:00:27.852
I should've told you
I was fired, I admit it.

00:00:27.932 --> 00:00:29.252
But I didn't want you
to worry.

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:30.652
You didn't want me
to worry?

00:00:30.732 --> 00:00:33.572
We're running
for our lives through
some godforsaken jungle.

00:00:33.652 --> 00:00:35.092
You keep trying
to pick a fight,

00:00:35.172 --> 00:00:36.892
but I'm just happy
you're alive.

00:00:39.332 --> 00:00:42.172
I know you're there,
Little Miss Disappear.

00:00:54.332 --> 00:00:56.652
You can't hide from me.

00:01:02.692 --> 00:01:04.012
There you are.

00:01:04.092 --> 00:01:05.292
DASH: Hey!

00:01:09.372 --> 00:01:11.012
Don't touch my sister!

00:01:18.852 --> 00:01:21.012
How are you
doing that?
I don't know!

00:01:21.092 --> 00:01:22.772
Whatever you do,
don't stop!

00:01:31.852 --> 00:01:33.212
(EXPLOSION)

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:41.332
Mom! Dad! Hey!

00:01:43.172 --> 00:01:44.212
HELEN: Kids.

00:01:44.332 --> 00:01:46.092
You're all right.
You're all right.

00:01:46.212 --> 00:01:47.412
We were so worried.

00:01:47.492 --> 00:01:48.692
I thought I'd never
see you again.

00:02:07.412 --> 00:02:08.492
BOTH: I love you.

00:02:08.612 --> 00:02:10.092
DASH: Wow.
Whoa.

00:02:24.772 --> 00:02:26.212
Time out!

00:02:27.692 --> 00:02:31.092
What have we here?
Matching uniforms?

00:02:32.132 --> 00:02:35.572
Oh, no! Elastigirl?

00:02:35.692 --> 00:02:36.932
(LAUGHS)

00:02:37.212 --> 00:02:40.412
You married Elastigirl?
Whoa!

00:02:41.532 --> 00:02:43.892
And got busy!

00:02:43.972 --> 00:02:46.532
It's a whole family
of supers.

00:02:46.612 --> 00:02:48.532
Looks like I've
hit the jackpot!

00:02:48.612 --> 00:02:51.212
Oh, this is
just too good!

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:53.292
(ON TV) The ship's
unique design...

00:02:53.412 --> 00:02:54.812
(ON TV) There were
no fatalities...

00:02:54.892 --> 00:02:56.372
Huh? Huh?

00:02:56.452 --> 00:02:59.892
Oh, come on!
You gotta admit,
this is cool.

00:02:59.972 --> 00:03:01.212
Just like a movie!

00:03:01.332 --> 00:03:03.212
The robot will
emerge dramatically,

00:03:03.332 --> 00:03:04.572
do some damage.

00:03:04.652 --> 00:03:06.092
Throngs of
screaming people!

00:03:06.212 --> 00:03:08.492
And just when
all hope is lost,

00:03:08.612 --> 00:03:10.932
Syndrome will
save the day!

00:03:11.172 --> 00:03:13.852
I'll be a bigger hero
than you ever were!

00:03:13.932 --> 00:03:16.212
You mean you killed off
real heroes

00:03:16.292 --> 00:03:18.092
so that you could
pretend to be one?

00:03:18.172 --> 00:03:20.932
Oh, I'm real.
Real enough
to defeat you!

00:03:21.012 --> 00:03:22.732
And I did it without
your precious gifts,

00:03:22.852 --> 00:03:25.092
your oh-so-special powers.

00:03:25.172 --> 00:03:26.332
I'll give them heroics.

00:03:26.492 --> 00:03:29.812
I'll give them the most
spectacular heroics
anyone's ever seen!

00:03:29.892 --> 00:03:33.092
And when I'm old
and I've had my fun,
I'll sell my inventions

00:03:33.172 --> 00:03:35.332
so that everyone
can be superheroes.

00:03:35.412 --> 00:03:37.492
Everyone can be super.

00:03:38.252 --> 00:03:40.452
(CHUCKLING)
And when everyone's super

00:03:43.532 --> 00:03:45.252
no one will be.

00:03:45.452 --> 00:03:47.052
(EVIL LAUGHTER)

00:04:06.692 --> 00:04:08.252
(SOLDIERS SHOUTING)

00:04:10.692 --> 00:04:12.692
Fire at will!

00:04:20.092 --> 00:04:22.812
(ON TV) It's overwhelming
the tanks.

00:04:22.892 --> 00:04:24.052
BOB: I'm sorry.

00:04:24.652 --> 00:04:28.292
This is my fault.
I've been a lousy father.

00:04:28.412 --> 00:04:30.292
Blind to what I have.

00:04:30.372 --> 00:04:32.212
So obsessed with
being undervalued

00:04:32.292 --> 00:04:34.132
that I undervalued
all of you.

00:04:34.252 --> 00:04:35.252
Dad?

00:04:35.332 --> 00:04:36.412
Shh. Don't interrupt.

00:04:36.532 --> 00:04:39.252
So caught up in
the past that I...

00:04:41.172 --> 00:04:43.492
You are my
greatest adventure.

00:04:43.572 --> 00:04:45.252
And I almost
missed it.

00:04:45.332 --> 00:04:47.332
I swear, I'm gonna get us
out of this safely if I...

00:04:47.412 --> 00:04:51.492
Well, I think Dad has
made some excellent
progress today

00:04:51.572 --> 00:04:54.252
but I think it's time
we wind down now.

00:04:57.412 --> 00:04:59.132
We need to get back
to the mainland.

00:04:59.212 --> 00:05:01.892
I saw an aircraft
hangar on my way in.
Straight ahead.

00:05:02.252 --> 00:05:04.052
(LAUGHTER)

00:05:11.892 --> 00:05:12.972
Where are all the guards?

00:05:13.772 --> 00:05:15.052
Go, go!

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:22.332
GUARD: Hey,
every time they run,
you take a shot.

00:05:27.772 --> 00:05:29.292
(FIGHTING)

00:05:31.532 --> 00:05:32.612
(WHISTLES)

00:05:38.532 --> 00:05:40.732
HELEN:
This is the right hangar,
but I don't see any jets.

00:05:40.812 --> 00:05:41.892
A jet's not fast enough.

00:05:41.972 --> 00:05:43.292
What's faster
than a jet?

00:05:44.252 --> 00:05:45.292
How about a rocket?

00:05:49.452 --> 00:05:51.252
Great! I can't
fly a rocket.

00:05:51.332 --> 00:05:53.092
VIOLET:
You don't have to.

00:05:53.652 --> 00:05:55.892
Use the coordinates
from the last launch.

00:05:57.972 --> 00:06:01.372
Wait. I bet
Syndrome's changed
the password by now.

00:06:01.452 --> 00:06:03.012
How do I get
into the computer?

00:06:03.132 --> 00:06:04.212
MIRAGE: Say please.

00:06:20.372 --> 00:06:22.132
Honey?
HONEY: What?

00:06:22.212 --> 00:06:24.532
Where is my supersuit?
What?

00:06:24.652 --> 00:06:27.772
Where is my supersuit?

00:06:27.852 --> 00:06:29.852
I put it away.

00:06:29.972 --> 00:06:30.972
Where?

00:06:31.052 --> 00:06:33.052
Why do you
need to know?

00:06:33.132 --> 00:06:34.452
I need it!

00:06:34.532 --> 00:06:37.452
Don't you think
about running off
doing no derrin'-do.

00:06:37.532 --> 00:06:39.452
We've been planning
this dinner for
two months!

00:06:39.532 --> 00:06:41.172
The public
is in danger!

00:06:41.252 --> 00:06:42.932
My evening's
in danger!

00:06:43.012 --> 00:06:44.532
Tell me where my
suit is, woman!

00:06:44.612 --> 00:06:46.452
We are talking about
the greater good.

00:06:46.532 --> 00:06:48.772
HONEY: "Greater good"?
I am your wife!

00:06:48.852 --> 00:06:51.692
I'm the greatest good
you are ever gonna get!

00:06:55.492 --> 00:06:56.892
Run!

00:06:58.612 --> 00:06:59.892
My baby!

00:07:04.652 --> 00:07:05.812
MAN: The supers
have returned!

00:07:05.892 --> 00:07:06.972
Is that Fironic?

00:07:07.052 --> 00:07:08.092
MAN: Fironic?

00:07:08.172 --> 00:07:10.292
No, Fironic has
a different outfit.

00:07:10.372 --> 00:07:15.412
No, no,
I'm a new superhero!
I'm Syndrome!

00:07:18.372 --> 00:07:20.252
All right, stand back.

00:07:23.892 --> 00:07:28.372
Someone needs to teach
this hunk of metal
a few manners.

00:07:30.212 --> 00:07:31.412
Ha, ha!

00:07:40.772 --> 00:07:42.532
(SYNDROME SCREAMING)

00:07:58.612 --> 00:08:00.012
Are we there yet?

00:08:00.092 --> 00:08:01.892
We get there
when we get there.

00:08:04.292 --> 00:08:06.372
BOB:
How you doing, honey?

00:08:06.452 --> 00:08:08.932
Do I have to answer?

00:08:11.372 --> 00:08:14.452
Kids, strap yourselves
down like I told you.

00:08:18.812 --> 00:08:20.452
Here we go, honey.

00:08:20.972 --> 00:08:22.172
Ready, Violet?

00:08:23.252 --> 00:08:25.212
Ready? Now!

00:08:28.972 --> 00:08:30.532
This is gonna be rough.

00:08:37.972 --> 00:08:40.292
Robot's in the
financial district.
Which exit?

00:08:40.372 --> 00:08:41.972
Traction Avenue.
That'll take me downtown.

00:08:42.092 --> 00:08:43.652
I take Seventh, don't I?
Don't take Seventh!

00:08:45.252 --> 00:08:46.372
Great, we missed it.

00:08:46.452 --> 00:08:47.732
Ask how to get there,
I told you.

00:08:47.812 --> 00:08:49.652
Traction.
That'll take me downtown.

00:08:49.772 --> 00:08:51.412
Get in the right lane!
Signal!

00:08:51.492 --> 00:08:53.012
Not Traction!
You're gonna miss it!

